# Popup keyboard smoke script (MFC-1013, MFC-1011): the Filters flyout takes focus when opened with Enter, Tab stays
# inside it, and Escape closes it and gives the focus back to the Filters chip.
#   dotnet run --project src/MediaFileClassifier.Desktop -- --smoke tools/ui-smoke/keyboard-popups.smoke --out artifacts/ui-smoke

window 1400x900
library sample
focus FiltersButton
key Enter
popup-key Tab
popup-key Tab
popup-shot 01-filters-flyout
popup-key Escape
wait-for no-popup 5s
shot 02-flyout-closed

# The focus is back on the Filters chip: Enter opens the flyout again.
key Enter
wait-for popup 5s
popup-key Escape
wait-for no-popup 5s
